		{"type":"text","id":"182bcdf6e9964f79","x":124,"y":-375,"width":380,"height":124,"color":"6","text":"Cyberpunk Edgerunners et JoJo (Golden Wind) questionnent le pouvoir et l'ambition a travers le parcours des personnages."},
		{"type":"text","id":"4dde634898bd46f2","x":-195,"y":-179,"width":380,"height":98,"color":"6","text":"JoJo (Golden Wind) et Mononoke integrent une dimension surnaturelle ou mystique dans leur univers."},
		{"type":"text","id":"ee201817c5594209","x":-1407,"y":-232,"width":376,"height":98,"color":"6","text":"Cyberpunk Edgerunners et Vinland Saga se situent dans un contexte technologique ou dystopique."},
		{"type":"text","id":"55650e83002c49d8","x":-493,"y":-393,"width":380,"height":124,"color":"6","text":"Cyberpunk Edgerunners, JoJo (Golden Wind) et Vinland Saga se deroulent dans des univers ou le combat et la violence occupent une place centrale."},
		{"type":"text","id":"c17751b77d5e4f64","x":-493,"y":-148,"width":380,"height":124,"color":"6","text":"Cyberpunk Edgerunners, JoJo (Golden Wind) et Mononoke interrogent l'identite et la transformation profonde des personnages."}
